  "label": "User projected onto the cat as the subject of defiance",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the white_cat, which is visually and textually presented as 'this kitty' in the meme. The text 'power of christ does not compel this kitty' directly addresses the cat as the subject of the statement, creating a semiotic projection where the user identifies with or imagines themselves as the cat, embodying the defiance or autonomy expressed in the text. The cat's calm, unimpressed demeanor visually reinforces this projection, allowing the user to see themselves in the cat's indifferent posture.",
